uuu_version 1.0.1

# Reach USB fastboot while IDME bootmode == "diags".
#
# uboot_diags2fastboot.bin is the stock U-Boot with the 18-byte
# "run bootcmd_diags" string replaced by "fastboot", so the diags branch calls
# fastboot instead of `bootm 0xE41000`. Regenerate it with:
#
#     python3 mk-patched-fastboot.py
#
# Mechanism, and why the stock U-Boot cannot work here: docs/DEVICE.md,
# Appendix A. No eMMC/IDME write -- this only changes the U-Boot the ROM loads
# into OCRAM.
#
# Once the device enumerates as 1949:d0e0, finish the job over fastboot:
#
#     uv run fastboot-setvar-reboot.py main
#
SDP: boot -f uboot_diags2fastboot.bin
